{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并敘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "智肱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或開為四十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或開六十卷或開八十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "國師諱也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "行者入道場敷具禮，\n三拜互跪，秉爐唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮一拜起，互\n跪，秉爐請云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三請三拜然後說偈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至此陳白，不然\n則修一疏宣之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從清涼字和之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下皆倣此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上革切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "私閏切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "入聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至此復跪，秉爐\n運想，披陳五悔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或運逆順十心，於理無爽。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下皆例此"}
{"id": null, "n": "0361a0801", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0361a0801", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0361c0301", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0361c0301", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
